      en: ["Shanga Ruins is a well-known historical in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Shanga Ruins plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Shanga Ruins.", "Shanga Ruins forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
